          </div>
          <div class="century-card">
            <span class="century-year">321 AD</span>
            <div class="century-title">Constantine&rsquo;s Sunday Law</div>
            <div class="century-desc">First civil Sunday law in history. <strong>&ldquo;On the venerable Day of the Sun&rdquo;</strong> &mdash; March 7, 321 AD. A Roman state decree, not a divine command. Andrews documents this in full.</div>
          </div>
