            <h3>Sermon on the Two Covenants</h3>
            <div class="book-year">1875</div>
            <p>Andrews addresses the two-covenant theology that was used to dismiss the law of God &mdash; presenting the biblical case for the perpetuity of the moral law including the seventh-day Sabbath.</p>
