      <div class="section">
        <div class="section-header">
          <div class="sh-eyebrow">Adventist Pioneer &amp; Scholar</div>
          <h2>Who Was J. N. Andrews?</h2>
          <p>From Maine farm boy to the most linguistically gifted scholar in early Adventism &mdash; the man who documented, with irrefutable historical precision, that the Sabbath was changed by Rome, not by God.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bio-grid">
          <div>
            <img
              src="/images/pioneers/john-nevins-andrews.jpg" loading="lazy"
