            />
            <p class="bio-caption">J. N. Andrews (1829&ndash;1883) &mdash; Scholar, Editor, First Overseas Adventist Missionary &mdash; Sent to Switzerland 1874</p>

            <div class="bio-facts">
              <div class="bio-fact">
                <div class="fact-label">Born</div>
